SUMMARY:Spitfire Shipwreck Virtual Reality Experience
DTSTART:20261013T100000
DTEND:20261013T120000
DTSTAMP:20260915T153719Z
UID:24519247fac45df00f5ee88ac5aa9f@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Want to know what it’s like to explore an underwater shipwre
 ck? Dive into the Lake Champlain Maritime Museum’s virtual reality tour 
 of Spitfire\, a 1776 gunboat that sank during the American retreat from Va
 lcour Bay. Using thousands of photos\, sonar images\, and videos of the wr
 eck\, we created a detailed\, 3-dimensional model which Champlain College 
 students transformed into this virtual reality dive. Stop by Fragments: Vo
 ices of the American Revolution on Lake Champlain and experience it for yo
 urself! Accessibility: From the flexi-pave path\, there is one wheelchair 
 accessible entrance to Fragments on the north side of the building. The ex
 hibit space is fully ADA compliant. Every week through Oct 15\, 2026.\n\nS
 ources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Lake Champlain Maritime Museum\, 4472 Basin Harbor Road
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/spitfire-s
 hipwreck-virtual-reality-experience-14-09-2026-14-34-29
